Labels (label_built, ob_presence) derive from Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal v1 (Google Research).
  Source: https://sites.research.google/gr/open-buildings/temporal
  Earth Engine: GOOGLE/Research/open-buildings-temporal/v1
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  Citation: W. Sirko et al. "High-resolution building and road detection from Sentinel-2." arXiv:2310.11622, 2023.

Features derive from modified Copernicus Sentinel-2 data (2020–2023), Level-2A harmonised surface reflectance,
accessed through Google Earth Engine (COPERNICUS/S2_SR_HARMONIZED).

Polygons: vacant lots of the Mapa Urbano Básico Digital de Goiânia (Prefeitura de Goiânia), identified only by an
integer index; no cadastral attribute is included.

APM layer (apms/apms_goiania.gpkg): municipal public areas register of the Prefeitura de Goiânia (SEPLANH),
as distributed in the UrbanMask repository (https://github.com/ThiagoHF31/urbanMask, data/apms.gpkg), with
fields identifying people (owner name, IPTU/cadastral registration) removed.

